  "description": "A team-of-three workout: a 1,065 m row or ski (or 1,065 ft VersaClimb), ten rounds of 13 deadlifts, 13 pull-ups, 13-calorie row, 13 back squats and 13 burpees, then the machine piece again, for time. Honours Petty Officer 3rd Class Ryan Patrick Comas of Philadelphia, who died by suicide in 2024. Rotate athletes so one works while two rest.",
